{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0074_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6ec1810c177a87a1af4bb41ce9d4bed686ac2c08d3479c4ac994650615c86a5b", "ja": "（環のライブのリハーサル中だが、この前撮った\nPVが届いた。早速、映像をチェックしてみよう）", "zh": "（环正在做演唱会的排练，刚好之前拍的PV送来了。\n赶紧来看看内容怎么样吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0074_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "5e6cef490e26e171cd383174487a8bf3eb6fd7ef41c62ffde4ae83172efa79fb", "ja": "おやぶん、なに見てるの？\nたまきも一緒に見る！", "zh": "老大，你在看什么呀？\n环也要一起看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0074_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6e9f7bbba335c5c7d83d2ab8fc708233963b331a0056eee694710886605093fd", "ja": "おっと、環か。\nもうリハーサル終わったのか？", "zh": "哦，是环呀。\n排练已经结束了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0074_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "c3da3d179e12bc38e91830064778779bb518ec7a20bc5d4756d157983f395086", "ja": "うん、バッチリだぞ！\n早く終わったから、おやぶんのとこに来たんだ♪", "zh": "嗯，非常顺利喔！\n因为提早结束，环就跑来找老大了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0074_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "9237ca4ecd61468827c114960f65d586e1af511d97609e7f4381e44bf1c821a8", "ja": "あっ！？　これ、たまきが映ってる！\nお～！　本とか時計と一緒に、浮いてるぞ～！？", "zh": "啊！？这里面有环！\n哇～！书跟时钟一起浮起来了耶～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0074_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "90e76a2360e103b1cf6c1155c5cf2e8e707bc5ba4ce365710548f59ddc019fdf", "ja": "たまき、これ知ってるよ！　CGっていうんでしょ？\nすごーい、本当に浮いてるみたいに見える～！", "zh": "环知道这个！这叫做CG对吧？\n好厉害～看起来就像真的浮在空中～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0074_1006_p", "source_sha256": "6af6a2b82b52c6bd3d437fd2f554dcdb2aed56b716402f0a22c3363fffaf32b4", "ja": "ああ、この前撮影してきたやつだ。\nCGもすごいけど、環の演技もなかなかいい感じだな。", "zh": "对啊，这是之前拍的。\nCG虽然很厉害，但环的演技也很不错呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0074_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "c607932a8272a2744b3bf136c1132de644f238cbd3e5e67d55e4af0a0860f58e", "ja": "ホント！？\nたまき、ちゃんとCGになってた？", "zh": "真的吗！？\n环有好好变成CG吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0074_1008_p", "source_sha256": "806b634638ba123b724460c44e7b78b1324b2c12f66c1a07cf657610e581053c", "ja": "いや、環はCGじゃなくて……まあいいか。\nでもすごく、PVの雰囲気に合ってたと思うよ。", "zh": "呃不，环不是CG……算了。\n我觉得你演的非常符合PV要的氛围喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0074_1009_p", "source_sha256": "56ea05fddc446d4a3c08ce1d007e4270fa436704e98a94416753886b091dd427", "ja": "よくやったな、環！", "zh": "做得漂亮，环！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0074_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "f4452f16428b35f72926e98a6b21ac19345ac1144d91f8a2fec9071cac3ab14e", "ja": "くふふ……おやぶんにほめられちゃった……♪", "zh": "呵呵……被老大称赞了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0074_1011_p", "source_sha256": "080a69f0e7f237146320bbe0063be8bbe7738b241fb400b0354f6ba955e2a361", "ja": "本を読むのが苦手だって言ってたのに、\nよく上手にできたな。何かコツがあるのか？", "zh": "我记得你说过自己不太喜欢看书，\n开拍时居然演得这么好。是有什么诀窍吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0074_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "6418c7900a08b91a7120784206c4d58293b68f307c4f14b32907de59d589999f", "ja": "う～んと……たまき、あんまり本知らないから、\n劇場のみんなに「何が面白い？」って聞いたんだ。", "zh": "这个嘛……因为环之前没看过几本书，\n就去问剧场的大家「有什么书很有趣吗？」喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0074_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "8f39d01074a2b6007e1a80e4b5d03482dabbf21a37eabf2af01588cf1c14ad1c", "ja": "そしたらね、みんながおススメの面白い本を\n持ってきてくれたんだぞ～！", "zh": "然后呀，大家就拿了\n她们觉得有趣的书推荐给环喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0074_1014_p", "source_sha256": "47f6377d84c13a9e6a6fa764e1b6890f2480d6a6bad163089d341e68634c2f90", "ja": "へえ、そうだったのか。", "zh": "喔～原来是这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0074_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "48d34e907b06bc20a199dc95f5f36ef8f7b9e2869fb17c712583c985044997d4", "ja": "読書感想文は、あんまり上手に書けなかったけど。\n本は、面白かった！", "zh": "环的阅读心得虽然写得不怎么样，\n但那些书很有趣！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0074_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "d0a253ee19ffde688e9546f52377ea1bf4e3cd0971268b2806898a5bb5a87c5f", "ja": "それに、PVの撮影も楽しかったし……\nだから読書は、ちょっと好きになったかも？", "zh": "而且拍PV时也很好玩……\n所以环好像有点喜欢上看书了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0074_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5107c2522d1ff78c328e530b7e5251aa77bb9c783885933175e8c824035d0f87", "ja": "そうか、それで上手くいったんだな。\nどんな本を読んだんだ？", "zh": "原来是这样才演得这么好。\n那你看了哪些书呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0074_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "a29a0065c489272283861146d8abaa6e9f0e91d1ca642e4ad755ef577f97a619", "ja": "えっとね、ゆりこに教えてもらった冒険のやつと、\nしほに教えてもらったネコの絵本と……。", "zh": "环想想，有百合子推荐的冒险故事书、\n志保推荐的猫咪绘本……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0074_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "c5bef8dc3f8490790c42d2a643916c29bb00fe5410903aec7c92bd350bdc6c27", "ja": "あ、あと、ことりに教えてもらった本は、\nむずかしくてちょっとよくわからなかった……。", "zh": "啊，还有小鸟推荐的书。\n那本太难了，环看得不是很懂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0074_1020_p", "source_sha256": "964eacd24d98300c51e91c8b0b7e31a1a19a47e8cdadef4f85f0d2ac15ac4c2c", "ja": "（音無さん……どんな本を？）", "zh": "（音无小姐……你到底推荐了什么？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0074_1021_040tam", "source_sha256": "9ff135413c9a2e961f5b5673d59cf9b71873b7a41f74bd6631cb358740849a4a", "ja": "あ、そうだっ！　ねえおやぶん、\nたまきがおやぶんに、面白い本を教えてあげる！", "zh": "啊，对了！老大你听环说，\n环要推荐有趣的书给老大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0074_1022_040tam", "source_sha256": "cb97badb46b63267ac6e1bbc8cab9af6bee3e9463193642b1ff449f88b1e8049", "ja": "いっぱい教えてあげるから、\n読み終わったら、感想文書いてね♪", "zh": "环会推荐很多书的，\n你看完以后要写心得喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0074_1023_p", "source_sha256": "a994c17c965542893e1b3f2eddc03eb06ce24b4a051d30145c0446a3b644cff2", "ja": "え……感想文って、俺が？", "zh": "咦……要我写心得吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0074_1024_040tam", "source_sha256": "d9a4a28551b01372a20eb01aadd580b161db893fffe9314d4e359f0bb6c9c432", "ja": "うん！　たまき、おやぶんの感想文読んでみたい！\n代わりにたまきの感想文も、読ませてあげるね！", "zh": "嗯！环想看老大写的心得！\n环也会把自己写的心得给你看的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0074_1025_040tam", "source_sha256": "36b1c66ff9cc61895fdba7f4466bbb83df27bce0c78580281e2215d145b81e38", "ja": "おやぶんの感想文だから、きっと超面白いぞ～！\nくふふ……♪", "zh": "老大写的心得，一定会很有意思～！\n呵呵……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0074_1026_p", "source_sha256": "04c284d2eeda2c797667c8a4af069ea4bf5e5859f58ef54600a8fb8c72d33652", "ja": "（ええと、感想文か……。\n感想文って、どう書いたらいいんだったかな……？）", "zh": "（我想想，心得呀……\n心得该怎么写来着……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
